Captures: what four machines showed about the hypervisor under them
====================================================================

Each folder is what lab-capture wrote on one machine; its SOURCE.txt says
which machine, when, and what was masked. All four were captured, not typed.

laptop-wsl2     a container on Docker Desktop on a Windows 11 laptop, whose
                Linux runs in WSL 2, a Hyper-V virtual machine
qemu-e1000      a QEMU guest under emulation with an emulated Intel network
                card and an IDE disk
qemu-virtio     a QEMU guest under emulation with a virtio network card and
                a virtio disk
qemu-two-nics   a QEMU guest under emulation with two network cards, one
                emulated and one virtio, and a virtio disk

lab-capture itself is /usr/local/bin/lab-capture: read it with
less /usr/local/bin/lab-capture.
